\title{MscoreDMR: differentially methylated regions from mHap data}
\description{
Detects differentially methylated regions from read-level methylation
haplotype (mHap) files. The main entry point is \code{\link[=dmr_mscore]{dmr_mscore()}}, which runs
candidate discovery (\code{\link[=find_mscore_candidates]{find_mscore_candidates()}}), two-stage GLS testing
(\code{\link[=fit_mscore_gls]{fit_mscore_gls()}}) and permutation-based FDR estimation in one call.
